# name       flags          description
# flags: nolink = do not symlink onto PATH; linux = Linux-only build
bash         -              GNU bash, statically linked
busybox      nolink,linux   hundreds of applets in one static binary
croc         -              encrypted file transfer with a code phrase
curl         nolink,linux   HTTP client, statically linked
dust         -              disk usage, sorted and visual
fd           -              friendlier find
fish         linux          friendly interactive shell
jq           -              JSON processor
rclone       -              sync to and from cloud storage
rg           -              ripgrep, fast recursive search
socat        linux          bidirectional data relay
wormhole     -              magic wormhole, encrypted transfer by code phrase
yq           -              YAML, JSON, and XML processor
zsh          -              zsh, relocatable build with its function tree
